---
source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: css/atrule/prelude_name_comments.css
---

# Input

```css
@page report
/* own line */ :first {margin:1in}
@namespace ns
/* own line */ url("http://example.com");
@page report /* first */ /* last */ :first {margin:1in}
@namespace ns /* first */ /* last */ url("http://example.com");
@page report /* multi
line */ :first {margin:1in}
@namespace ns /* multi
line */ url("http://example.com");
@namespace ns /* first */ /* biome-ignore format: preserve URL */ /* last */ url( "http://example.com" );

```


# Formatted

```css
@page report /* own line */ :first {
	margin: 1in;
}
@namespace ns /* own line */ url("http://example.com");
@page report /* first */ /* last */ :first {
	margin: 1in;
}
@namespace ns /* first */ /* last */ url("http://example.com");
@page report /* multi
line */ :first {
	margin: 1in;
}
@namespace ns /* multi
line */ url("http://example.com");
@namespace ns /* first */ /* biome-ignore format: preserve URL */ /* last */ url( "http://example.com" );

```

# Lines exceeding max width of 80 characters
```
   15: @namespace ns /* first */ /* biome-ignore format: preserve URL */ /* last */ url( "http://example.com" );
```
